      "message": "fix(post): honor machine tool reservations\n\nRead reserved machine tool numbers and names. Keep cutting tools out of\nprobe and tool-setter selectors during allocation, imports and edits.\nBlock unsafe existing assignments during verification and posting.\nCheck standalone post streams before output and retain the physical tool\nidentity across sections.\n\nCo-authored-by: Codex <noreply@openai.com>\n\nFixes #2604",
