      },
      "message": "fix(project): step the file to v77 for stored tool reservations\n\nAddress the second review of PR #3284:\n- Step PROJECT_VERSION to 77. A stored machine can hold reserved_tools,\n  so an older reader must refuse the file. A v76 file steps up unchanged.\n  Rule entries in project/file.rs and project/apply.rs.\n- Remove the T99 probe reservation from the 18 Tormach machine files.\n  No public Tormach document that names T99 was cited.\n- Add the tooling.reserved row to assets/machines/AGENTS.md.\n- Correct the add_tool numbering text (MCP tool, reference, skill).\n- Regenerate the version of the continuous 4-axis example project.\n\nPinned by saved_machine_reservations_need_the_v77_reader,\na_v76_machine_steps_up_with_no_reservation and\nshipped_machines_reserve_no_pocket_without_a_cited_manual.\n\nRefs #2604\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
